  rows with Renyi sum < 1 (non-trivial): 1849; largest exact/Renyi ratio among them: 0.674
  Thm 4.1(vi): P[Pi(C\E) > B_eps] > eps in 0 (class, lambda, n, eps) cases; smallest slack eps - P = 1.000e-02; cases with B_eps < 1 (non-trivial): 1
  Thm 3.2: max |E*-share of the E-posterior - w_lambda| at n = 128 (rows with Pi(E) > 0.999): 2.22e-16
